{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成人の皆様、おめでとうございます!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤詩織です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN27PE7C1ACF2X52EB0KMMK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のブログ、袴って間違えてて書いちゃってた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしは 赤と黒の振袖着ました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN27QGYCFMWGH80NSMEBVGT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代々着ているやつで、姉も成人の時着ててすごく早く着たかったから、\nやっと着れたーー!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お着物はやっぱり、素敵ですね。\n気が引き締まります!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃんっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN27S8GKTKCQ7ZC0AW9PGEV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN27VEDZVNZQ7CADN3RHDNV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろも、帯、素敵にして頂きました!\n菊のお花みたいに、らしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振袖、黒と赤に、差し色でブルーグリーン!\n最高に わたしのツボです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳になってみても、やはり何も変わらず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、もっとしっかりしたいなとも思います!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、最近、明確に目標が出来たんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先のことは、誰だって   何もわからない。\nだから、誰だって    不安になるものなんだなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、しっかり目の前にある目標を一つ一つクリアにしていけば、\n必ず 何かしら見えるもの、得るものがあるだろうなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たり前に感じることを、焦りと不安に駆られていた20歳まで。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳の節目で、焦りと不安を無くして、淡々と、黙々と、こなしていきたいなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良い意味で、マイペースでね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN27WYPVMZBYXMP2QTCTB1Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族で美味しいご飯を頂きました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN27Z2S6SRPWYRBK2XH5NHG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都に本店を構えるお店の、黒毛和牛のステーキとすき焼き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高に幸せでした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からまた、頑張るぞ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ!KEYABINGO2 いよいよ今夜始まりますよ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、お見逃しなく!!\nうきうきハッピーー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"bre